01291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=18241MhYDUQQ7kNvwGTWbwm&_nc_oc=AdqPPly_wYtnUTgGnrDiEC_ION7qJONnTHBkhdqOBFD4kCmTf89Qvdkgq07s0J53qpM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_CqHHDOY022n7JvNlBN5tlk-6LcE64ZL6ZCXNkYN9C1w&oe=6A301D7D"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iuFRJyX0br8Q7kNvwHhutil&_nc_oc=Adqz0RZ73EXXMxXd-DTRzNSC5GQ2l_DqMtlC7cl1iq9NdEodr4pVNH3D0bA21moKwZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9x3DDpffdCMoNIQfsG_ApfDoXndMDVABWVahi7drmTMA&oe=6A3003BB"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ha4JW67i4QAQ7kNvwHEkkwD&_nc_oc=Adpf7PNFiz7qU0eHcZpeg0sIlr8weGmoxFs4JQbUXKRAXESaENLBN7nYz2rlw1LMsBE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_8onQivckMj1_4bCPX2Cqgt5GMpoG3nGOzyLRvxZ-_sQ&oe=6A3018E5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a